## 三、Phase 2: 分镜设计

### 3.1 分镜脚本模板

```yaml
# 分镜脚本模板
page_id: "EP01-P03"  # 话数-页数
layout_type: "standard_6" | "full_page" | "double_page" | "irregular"

panels:
  - panel_id: 1
    size: "large"  # large/medium/small/strip
    position: "top-full"  # 位置描述
    
    # 构图信息
    shot_type: "wide" | "medium" | "close-up" | "extreme-close-up" | "bird-eye" | "worm-eye"
    angle: "straight" | "dutch" | "low" | "high"
    
    # 场景内容
    scene_ref: "P1-S01"
    description: "岑回站在维修局大厅，看着闸机屏幕"
    
    # 人物
    characters:
      - name: "岑回"
        position: "center-left"
        action: "站立，看屏幕"
        expression: "困惑"
        
    # 背景
    background: "维修局大厅，灰色调，冷光"
    
    # 对白
    dialogue:
      - type: "bubble"  # bubble/thought/narration/sfx
        speaker: "屏幕"
        text: "身份：核对中。"
        position: "top-right"
        
    # 特效
    effects:
      - type: "screen_glow"
        description: "屏幕发出冷光"
        
    # 提示词生成指引
    prompt_hints:
      style: "赛博朋克漫画风格"
      emphasis: "冷色调，科幻氛围"
      avoid: "过于明亮，卡通化"
```

